    "n-start": {"x": -500, "y": 0, "w": 400, "text": "Start with the Prototype and press Play. It is a working scorer on turn 5: tap the pitch, the big button and UNDO. Its Tweaks switch the capture level, the view and dark.\n\nEvery other live-scoring frame is the same scorer opened at one moment, so each of them can be played too."},
    "n-taps": {"x": -500, "y": 420, "w": 400, "text": "Turn 5, tap by tap\n3 kubbs in, then 3F B B B - K\n\nTurn line only: 13 taps\nALL 3 IN (1). Three kubbs, 3 DOWN (4). Kubb, 1 DOWN, three times (6). MISS (1). KING DOWN (1).\n\nPlus where kubbs stand (@ and *): 15 taps\nThree taps on the pitch replace ALL 3 IN.\n\nPlus who threw: no more taps in order, 2 for each baton out of order.\n\nPlus thrown from (^): 2 more at least\nOne tap sets the spot and it sticks. One more when the king shot moves to the baseline."}
